            <ArticleTitle>Answers to Clinical Questions in the Primary Care Management of People with Obesity: Lifestyle Management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S13-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Lifestyle modification is not a short-term endeavor, and maintaining a healthy weight requires sustained changes in dietary and physical activity. Intensive behavioral intervention can help modify deep-rooted behaviors and provide the support required to both initiate and maintain the behavioral changes that are needed to achieve weight loss goals.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
